{"SystemName":"Customer.WelcomeMessage","Title":"{{Store.Name}}\u0027e Ho\u015F Geldiniz","Content":"\u003Cdiv style=\u0022font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 5px;\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\u0022text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\u0022\u003E\u003Ch1 style=\u0022color: #333333;\u0022\u003E{{Store.Name}}\u0027e Ho\u015F Geldiniz!\u003C/h1\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022color: #444444; line-height: 1.5;\u0022\u003EMerhaba {{Customer.FirstName}},\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022color: #444444; line-height: 1.5;\u0022\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022{{Store.URL}}\u0022 style=\u0022color: #4285f4; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;\u0022\u003E{{Store.Name}}\u003C/a\u003E\u0027e \u00FCye oldu\u011Funuz i\u00E7in te\u015Fekk\u00FCr ederiz.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022color: #444444; line-height: 1.5;\u0022\u003EArt\u0131k size sundu\u011Fumuz \u00E7e\u015Fitli hizmetlerden yararlanabilirsiniz. Bu hizmetlerden baz\u0131lar\u0131 \u015Funlar\u0131 i\u00E7erir:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul style=\u0022color: #444444; line-height: 1.5;\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKal\u0131c\u0131 Sepet\u003C/strong\u003E - \u00C7evrimi\u00E7i sepetinize ekledi\u011Finiz \u00FCr\u00FCnler, siz kald\u0131rana veya sat\u0131n alana kadar orada kal\u0131r.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAdres Defteri\u003C/strong\u003E - Art\u0131k \u00FCr\u00FCnlerimizi sizinkinden ba\u015Fka bir adrese de g\u00F6nderebiliriz! Bu, do\u011Fum g\u00FCn\u00FC hediyelerini do\u011Frudan do\u011Fum g\u00FCn\u00FC olan ki\u015Fiye g\u00F6ndermek i\u00E7in m\u00FCkemmeldir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESipari\u015F Ge\u00E7mi\u015Fi\u003C/strong\u003E - Bizimle yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z al\u0131\u015Fveri\u015Flerin ge\u00E7mi\u015Fini g\u00F6r\u00FCnt\u00FCleyebilirsiniz.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u00DCr\u00FCn \u0130ncelemeleri\u003C/strong\u003E - \u00DCr\u00FCnler hakk\u0131ndaki g\u00F6r\u00FC\u015Flerinizi di\u011Fer m\u00FC\u015Fterilerimizle payla\u015Fabilirsiniz.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022color: #444444; line-height: 1.5;\u0022\u003E\u00C7evrimi\u00E7i hizmetlerimizden herhangi biri hakk\u0131nda yard\u0131ma ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z olursa, l\u00FCtfen ma\u011Faza sahibine e-posta g\u00F6nderin: \u003Ca href=\u0022mailto:{{Store.Email}}\u0022 style=\u0022color: #4285f4; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;\u0022\u003E{{Store.Email}}\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022color: #444444; line-height: 1.5;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENot:\u003C/strong\u003E Bu e-posta adresi kay\u0131t sayfam\u0131zda sa\u011Flanm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r. E-postan\u0131n sahibi sizseniz ve sitemize kay\u0131t olmad\u0131ysan\u0131z, l\u00FCtfen \u003Ca href=\u0022mailto:{{Store.Email}}\u0022 style=\u0022color: #4285f4; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;\u0022\u003E{{Store.Email}}\u003C/a\u003E adresine bir e-posta g\u00F6nderin.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\u0022margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e6e6e6; text-align: center; color: #777777; font-size: 12px;\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u00A9 {{Store.Name}} - T\u00FCm Haklar\u0131 Sakl\u0131d\u0131r\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\u0022margin: 10px 0;\u0022\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022{{Store.FacebookLink}}\u0022 style=\u0022text-decoration: none; margin: 0 5px;\u0022\u003EFacebook\u003C/a\u003E | \u003Ca href=\u0022{{Store.TwitterLink}}\u0022 style=\u0022text-decoration: none; margin: 0 5px;\u0022\u003ETwitter\u003C/a\u003E | \u003Ca href=\u0022{{Store.InstagramLink}}\u0022 style=\u0022text-decoration: none; margin: 0 5px;\u0022\u003EInstagram\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cp\u003E{{Store.CompanyAddress}}\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","LiquidTokens":null}
